physical_scope: \"Perturbative local anomaly matching for one positive-chirality charge-one Weyl field, one neutral negative-chirality mass partner, and a retained charge-one Goldstone phase under small background U(1)_X transformations. It asserts no dynamical-gauge consistency, large-transformation/global anomaly, gravitational term, non-Abelian generalization, or continuum limit.\"
proof_strategy: direct
