    - title: \"John Preskill, Gauge Anomalies in an Effective Field Theory\"
      url: \"https://preskill.caltech.edu/pubs/preskill-1991-effective.pdf\"
      locator: \"Full 78-page lecture-note PDF inspected; §6.3–6.4, Eqs. (6.34)–(6.45), for the Wess–Zumino variation and the mass-independent anomaly induced by integrating out Yukawa-massive chiral fermions.\"
